  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business trip of 2 representatives of the Slovak Medical Chamber to Belarus</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pracovn&#xe1; cesta 2 z&#xe1;stupcov Slovenskej lek&#xe1;rskej komory (SLK) do Bieloruska</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Bielorusk&#xe1; asoci&#xe1;cia lek&#xe1;rov (BAL) sa obr&#xe1;tila na Slovensk&#xfa; lek&#xe1;rsku komoru (SLK) so &#x17e;iados&#x165;ou o&#xa0;uskuto&#x10d;nenie spolo&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho stretnutia (semin&#xe1;ru), v&#xa0;r&#xe1;mci ktor&#xe9;ho bude uskuto&#x10d;nen&#xe1; v&#xfd;mena praktick&#xfd;ch sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; a&#xa0;bude podp&#xed;san&#xe1; dohoda o&#xa0;vz&#xe1;jomnej spolupr&#xe1;ci oboch organiz&#xe1;ci&#xed;.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;V&#xa0;r&#xe1;mci stretnutia mala bielorusk&#xe1; strana z&#xe1;ujem o&#xa0;v&#xfd;menu sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; v nasledovn&#xfd;ch oblastiach:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Poskytovanie pr&#xe1;vnej pomoci medic&#xed;nskym pracovn&#xed;kom.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Vplyv lek&#xe1;rskej komory na etick&#xe9; aspekty medic&#xed;nskej &#x10d;innosti.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&#xda;&#x10d;as&#x165; a&#xa0;organiz&#xe1;cia spolo&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch tematick&#xfd;ch lek&#xe1;rskych konferenci&#xed; s &#xfa;&#x10d;as&#x165;ou praktizuj&#xfa;cich lek&#xe1;rov a&#xa0;univerzitn&#xfd;ch medikov.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&#xda;loha n&#xe1;u&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch medic&#xed;nskych magaz&#xed;nov vo vzdel&#xe1;van&#xed; a&#xa0;zvy&#x161;ovan&#xed; kvalifik&#xe1;cie lek&#xe1;rov.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Sk&#xfa;senosti Slovenskej lek&#xe1;rskej komory s&#xa0;poskytovan&#xed;m zahrani&#x10d;nej zdravotn&#xed;ckej pomoci slovensk&#xfd;mi lek&#xe1;rmi.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Belarusian Association of Physicians&#xa0;contacted the Slovak Medical Chamber (SLK) with a request to hold a joint meeting (seminar) to share best practice and to sign memorandum on mutual cooperation&#xa0;between both organizations.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Belarusian side had an interest in exchanging experience in the following areas:&lt;br /&gt;1. Providing legal aid to&#xa0;medical personnel.&lt;br /&gt;2. Effect of the Medical Association on the ethical aspects of medical activity.&lt;br /&gt;3. Participation and organization of joint thematic conferences - attendance of&#xa0;medical practitioners, doctors and university&#xa0;students.&lt;br /&gt;4. The role of educational magazines in medical education and professional development of doctors.&lt;br /&gt;5. Experience of Slovak Medical Chamber&#xa0;in providing foreign aid by Slovak&#xa0;medical&#xa0;doctors.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
